xml-to-json.workedExample:
Input:
<catalog><book id="bk101"><title>XML Guide</title><price>29.99</price></book></catalog>
Output:
{
  "catalog": {
    "book": {
      "@id": "bk101",
      "title": "XML Guide",
      "price": "29.99"
    }
  }
}
Two <book> siblings would produce "book": [ {...}, {...} ] instead.
